  "title": {
    "rendered": "سورة الهمزة مكتوبة بخط كبير: 9 آية مع الترجمة الإنجليزية"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">نقدم سورة الهمزة مكتوبة بخط كبير، وعدد آياتها 9، مع تلاوة صوتية آية بآية.</p>\n\n\n<div style=\"background-color: #EAEAEA; padding: 15px; text-align: center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic', Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0;\">بِسْمِ اللَّهِ الرَّحْمَٰنِ الرَّحِيمِ</h2>\n</div>\n\n\n<p><script type=\"text/javascript\">\n  function changesoundy(ID) {\n    var sound_id = document.getElementById(\"quran_player_by_sora\");\n    sound_id.innerHTML = '<div style=\"margin-top:15px;\"><audio controls autoplay><source src=\"'+ID+'\" type=\"audio/mpeg\">متصفحك لا يدعم عنصر الصوت</audio><br /><a href=\"'+ID+'\">تنزيل الملف</a></div>';\n  }\n</script><h2 class=\"sora_title\">سورة الهمزة</h2><div id=\"quran_player_by_sora\"></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/104001.mp3');\">وَيْلٌ لِّكُلِّ هُمَزَةٍ لُّمَزَةٍ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الهمزة [1]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/104002.mp3');\">الَّذِي جَمَعَ مَالًا وَعَدَّدَهُ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الهمزة [2]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/104003.mp3');\">يَحْسَبُ أَنَّ مَالَهُ أَخْلَدَهُ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الهمزة [3]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/104004.mp3');\">كَلَّا ۖ لَيُنبَذَنَّ فِي الْحُطَمَةِ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الهمزة [4]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/104005.mp3');\">وَمَا أَدْرَاكَ مَا الْحُطَمَةُ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الهمزة [5]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/104006.mp3');\">نَارُ اللَّهِ الْمُوقَدَةُ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الهمزة [6]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/104007.mp3');\">الَّتِي تَطَّلِعُ عَلَى الْأَفْئِدَةِ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الهمزة [7]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/104008.mp3');\">إِنَّهَا عَلَيْهِم مُّؤْصَدَةٌ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الهمزة [8]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/104009.mp3');\">فِي عَمَدٍ مُّمَدَّدَةٍ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الهمزة [9]</span></div></div></p>\n",
    "protected": false
  },
